{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polyjump - The Ultimate Speedrunner\u2019s Playground</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589210/extras/fe5935d35c23a31fee3cfa8294853c31.poster.avif?t=1762580164\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589210/extras/fe5935d35c23a31fee3cfa8294853c31.webm?t=1762580164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589210/extras/fe5935d35c23a31fee3cfa8294853c31.mp4?t=1762580164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast, jump faster! Polyjump is a high-speed, precision platformer built for those who love the thrill of the perfect run. Control a nimble sphere and race against the clock across beautiful low-poly worlds, where every jump, every shortcut, and every split-second decision matters. Beware... it looks easy, but true mastery lies in finding the perfect momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589210/extras/175f798d08e23175534c86204646aa65.poster.avif?t=1762580164\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589210/extras/175f798d08e23175534c86204646aa65.webm?t=1762580164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589210/extras/175f798d08e23175534c86204646aa65.mp4?t=1762580164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every millisecond counts. Compete on global leaderboards, crush rival times, and prove you\u2019re the fastest in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrunner\u2019s Paradise</strong>\u00a0- Optimize your jumps, find the fastest routes, and chase perfection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Unique Worlds (More Coming!)</strong>\u00a0- Each with its own challenges, hazards, and dynamic environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Handcrafted Levels</strong>\u00a0- Master each stage and fight for leaderboard dominance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics &amp; Weather Mechanics</strong>\u00a0- Wind, ice, and other tricky surfaces test your control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Racing System</strong>\u00a0- Race against your personal best ghost recordings to improve your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Leaderboards</strong>\u00a0- Compete globally and prove you\u2019re the fastest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Content On The Way</strong>\u00a0- New worlds, levels, events and free DLC coming soon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump in now and shape the future of Polyjump!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/589210?t=1762580164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/589210?t=1762580164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589210/d5a50a2217c4b19352c56b09133b44b5cef8756e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762580164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/589210/d5a50a2217c4b19352c56b09133b44b5cef8756e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762580164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"d